2026-10-22T18:58:50.0828148Z [36;1m# The csimp real-build controls also inspect QlvrTool.runSideIndex,[0m
2026-10-22T18:58:50.0828607Z [36;1m# declared in Harness.Qlvr outside both import closures. Build its[0m
2026-10-22T18:58:50.0829038Z [36;1m# Lean/C artifacts; the native l4qlvr executable is not needed.[0m
2026-10-22T18:58:50.0829465Z [36;1m# The source-wide csimp inventory also includes CryptoProbe.[0m
2026-10-22T18:58:50.0830025Z [36;1mlake build L4Factoidal l4wasm +Harness.Qlvr +Harness.CryptoProbe 2>&1 | tee "$RUNNER_TEMP/lake-build.log"[0m
